       <h1>Google Play Offers Discounts on Select Retailer Gift Cards</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#tech</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Through October 19th, the Google Play store is offering discounts of up to 20 percent on various gift cards. Available deals include 20 percent off $50 Barnes and Noble cards, 20 percent off $100 REI cards, and 10 percent off $100 GameStop cards.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-14/google-play-offers-discounts-on-select-retailer-gift-cards.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Shoppers do not need an Android device to participate, though a Google Play account is required. In addition to retail gift cards, the promotion features discounts on digital subscriptions like Calm and DuoLingo, alongside in-game bonuses for titles such as Pokémon Go and PUBG Mobile.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is concise, accurate, and includes all relevant details and figures provided in the source.</p>
