       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-10-14 · editor 6/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Guwahati woman dragged by scooter-borne snatchers as crime spree hits city</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>A woman was dragged 50 metres in Guwahati’s Kahilipara area after two men on a scooter attempted to snatch her bag. CCTV footage captured the struggle, and police have launched a manhunt for the perpetrators. The incident has prompted concerns regarding local law and order.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-14/guwahati-woman-dragged-by-scooter-borne-snatchers-as-crime-s.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Separately, legal developments include the death penalty for two men in the Blue Drum murder case of officer Saurabh Rajput, and a probe into the death of businessman Shiva Sharma, with his partner named the prime accused. Additionally, tensions in Delhi followed the return of Cockroach Janata Party founder Abhijeet Deepke amidst ongoing party legal battles.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief contains significant extraneous information (Blue Drum case, CJP politics) not central to the primary lead of the Guwahati incident.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/video/guwahati-bag-snatching-bid-woman-dragged-50-metres-by-scooter-borne-men-incident-caught-on-cctv-ytvd-3017271-2026-10-14?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/guwahati/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Guwahati</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
