       <h1>IIT Kanpur Launches $1 Billion Fundraising Campaign, Announces Rs 180-Crore Innovation School</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#IIT Kanpur</span> <span>#Fundraising</span> <span>#Innovation School</span> <span>#Noida</span></div>
       <p>The Indian Institute of Technology (IIT) Kanpur has initiated a significant $1 billion fundraising campaign, as reported by The Indian Express. This ambitious financial drive aims to bolster the institution's future initiatives and expansion plans.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-14/iit-kanpur-launches-1-billion-fundraising-campaign-announces.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Concurrently with the fundraising launch, IIT Kanpur also announced the establishment of a new innovation school. This facility, projected to cost Rs 180 crore, will be located in Noida, marking a notable investment in educational infrastructure.</p><p>The dual announcement highlights IIT Kanpur's strategic vision for growth and its commitment to fostering innovation. Further details regarding the school's programs or the fundraising timeline were not specified in the source.</p><p>What to watch: Progress of IIT Kanpur's fundraising campaign and the development of the new innovation school.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Thoroughly incorporates all specific facts and figures from the headline summary into a well-structured brief.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.?oc=5" rel="noopener">Education (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
