     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-10-14 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Kolkata's Chingrighata Flyover Becomes Slippery as Painted Surface Causes Biker Skids</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Fresh decorative paint applied to Kolkata's Chingrighata Flyover ahead of Durga Puja turned dangerously slick after light rain, causing multiple two-wheeler riders to skid and lose control. Dashcam footage captured the incidents on the elevated transit link connecting the Eastern Metropolitan Bypass to Sector V. Road safety experts and urban planners criticized the use of standard enamel paint, noting that it lacks anti-skid properties and drastically reduces friction on bitumen surfaces during wet weather. Public pressure is mounting on municipal authorities to evaluate skid resistance and apply corrective measures.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-14/kolkatas-chingrighata-flyover-becomes-slippery-as-painted-su.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately summarizes the incident and safety concerns from the source text.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/cities/kolkata-news/kolkatas-state-of-the-art-flyover-becomes-a-slippery-slope-bikes-skid-on-painted-surface-after-durga-puja-makeover-watch-ws-lr-10382174.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/kolkata/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kolkata</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
