     <article class="story single" data-beat="finance">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">FINANCE</span> · Livemint Money · 2026-10-14 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Mukhyamantri Ladli Behna Yojana: MP CM Releases 41st Installment Today</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Personal Finance</span> <span>#Government Scheme</span> <span>#Madhya Pradesh</span> <span>#Financial Aid</span></div>
       <p>The Madhya Pradesh Chief Minister is set to release the 41st installment of the Mukhyamantri Ladli Behna Yojana today, Wednesday, October 15. This initiative provides direct financial assistance to women in the state.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-14/mukhyamantri-ladli-behna-yojana-mp-cm-releases-41st-installm.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Under this upcoming distribution, approximately 1.25 crore women beneficiaries are slated to receive money transfers. The total amount to be disbursed in this installment will exceed ₹1,834 crore.</p><p>For ordinary savers and taxpayers, this represents a significant state welfare program. The direct transfer of funds aims to support the financial well-being of a large segment of the female population, potentially boosting local economies through increased spending power for recipient households.</p><p>What to watch: The ongoing impact of these direct benefit transfers on household finances.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Covers all available source facts regarding the scheme payout, beneficiary counts, and dates.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.livemint.com/money/personal-finance/mukhyamantri-ladli-behna-yogna-mp-cm-to-release-41st-installment-today-heres-how-to-check-payment-11791973457745.html" rel="noopener">Livemint Money</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
