      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/asaduddin-owaisi-advises-young-men-marry-before-saying-i-love-you-3016885-2026-10-14?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
