       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">TECH</span> · TechCrunch · 2026-10-14 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>TechCrunch Offers 50% Off Tickets for Remaining Days of Disrupt 2026 in San Francisco</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#tech</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>TechCrunch is offering a 50% discount on tickets for the final two days of Disrupt 2026 at San Francisco's Moscone West, running October 14-15. Attendees can access all ticket types at half price, including Founder, Attendee, Investor, Non-profit, Student, and Expo+ passes. The event features two flagship AI stages with speakers from OpenAI, Anthropic, and Hugging Face, alongside over 320 exhibitors, breakout sessions, and the Startup Battlefield 200 pitch competition. Participants can also buy a second pass at 50% off to bring a colleague to the startup ecosystem gathering.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-14/techcrunch-offers-50-off-tickets-for-remaining-days-of-disru.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately reflects the source text regarding the discount, dates, location, and specific pricing details.</p>
