      <ul><li><a href="https://sports.ndtv.com/cricket/india-vs-west-indies-live-score-4th-t20i-ind-vs-wi-match-live-updates-vaibhav-sooryavanshi-sanju-samson-abhishek-sharma-12184480#publisher=newsstand" rel="noopener">NDTV Sports</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
